    {
      "name": "Revelator",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/skills/melee/strike-weapon-polearm-ice-blue.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p><strong>For he who comes in our time of need is not of mortal breed, he is the Destroyer, the right hand of our Creator and the one who brings fear where there is no hope.</strong></p><p><em>—Corrax Tablet 3:13, Doom Eternal</em></p><p>Revelators are warriors of radiance and justice. These oathsworn knights hold an honorable vow that becomes its own power.</p><h3>Iconic Revelators</h3><ul><li><strong>Luke Skywalker</strong>, <em>Star Wars</em></li><li><strong>Michael Carpenter</strong>, <em>The Dresden Files</em></li><li><strong>She-Ra</strong>, <em>She-Ra: Princess of Power</em></li><li><strong>Wonder Woman</strong>, <em>DC Comics</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Revelator</h3><p>Revelators are high defense frontline strikers. Stay in the frontline for melee attacks, and smite the transgressors.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Attack/Cast<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Frontline<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Knight or Warrior<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Might/Presence<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★★☆☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Leadership, Melee</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Spells</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Mana</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Cast Max</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Righteous, Enspell</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Lay on Hands (d4)</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Paragon’s Aura (1 Mana)</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>10</p></td><td><p>4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Lay on Hands (d6), Divine Resolve</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>12</p></td><td><p>4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>14</p></td><td><p>5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Paragon’s Aura (2 Mana)</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>16</p></td><td><p>5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>18</p></td><td><p>6</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Lay on Hands (d8), Holy Diver</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>20</p></td><td><p>6</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "isSpellcaster": true,
        "levelFeatures": [
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Righteous",
            "description": "<p>You gain the Gish Perk (p. 69), can Cast Spells using Leadership.</p><p><strong>Spells:</strong> You learn 2 Spells, one of which must always have a damage base. You learn 1 other Spell every 3 Levels hereafter.</p><p><strong>Mana:</strong> Your Max Mana is equal to (2 × your Level), and your Cast Max for Spells is equal to (1 + half your Level, round up).</p>",
